[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 61.15, "timestamp": "00:01:01", "text": "我做到了。我来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 65.35, "timestamp": "00:01:05", "text": "后退。我吃了东西。我感觉很累，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 68.95, "timestamp": "00:01:08", "text": "也已刷新。拿到了一些药。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 70.95, "timestamp": "00:01:10", "text": "有。是的。是的。是的。我弄到了一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 73.429, "timestamp": "00:01:13", "text": "顺便提一下，这是复合维生素药。我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 75.469, "timestamp": "00:01:15", "text": "一些复合维生素"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 77.39, "timestamp": "00:01:17", "text": "药品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 81.59, "timestamp": "00:01:21", "text": "嗯，是的。是的。是的。比如复合维生素"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 83.91, "timestamp": "00:01:23", "text": "多种矿物质，含葡萄籽提取物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 85.95, "timestamp": "00:01:25", "text": "平板电脑不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 88.95, "timestamp": "00:01:28", "text": "中性还可以，或者别的什么，嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 93.83, "timestamp": "00:01:33", "text": "名为锌钴顶点锌渴望顶点它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 95.83, "timestamp": "00:01:35", "text": "15片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 100.19, "timestamp": "00:01:40", "text": "呃，我可以要一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 102.95, "timestamp": "00:01:42", "text": "那天我一定会带上这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 105.50999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:45", "text": "因为我得了口腔溃疡，或者类似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 109.10900000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:49", "text": "目前口腔孢子问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 111.19, "timestamp": "00:01:51", "text": "或许是因为我饮食不规律。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 114.22999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:54", "text": "或许是因为我吃饭比较晚，没有定时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 117.429, "timestamp": "00:01:57", "text": "呃，吃饭什么的。我不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 119.749, "timestamp": "00:01:59", "text": "即使吃很多东西，对吧？只有一个勺子"}]